Changing a bridge (switch) to become the root bridge in a VLAN
(config)#spanning-tree vlan [vlan number] root [primary | secondary]
Ex: spanning-tree vlan 10 root secondary
    spanning-tree vlan 20 root primary

Changing the priority of a bridge (switch) for STP calculation
(config)#spanning-tree vlan [vlan number] priority [value in multiples of 4096]
Ex: spanning-tree vlan 20 priority 20480

Changing the STP version
(config)#spanning-tree mode [pvst | rapid-pvst]
